# Credentials must never be committed. W&B auth lives in ~/.netrc (mode 600,
# machine api.wandb.ai), outside the repo entirely; these patterns exist so a
# local env file used as an alternative cannot be added by accident. Until
# 2026-09-15 the W&B key was inline in every run_job*.sh --export line.
.env
.env.*
*.env
.netrc
secrets.sh
wandb.env
